q('A mountain breeze generally occurs:',['after sunset as cool dense air flows downslope','at noon as warm air sinks','only during storms','because oceans heat faster'],0,['Correct.','Warm air rises.','Not limited to storms.','Not the mechanism.']),
q('Earth’s rotation deflects winds toward the right in the:',['Northern Hemisphere','Southern Hemisphere','Equator only','Both equally'],0,['Correct.','Southern Hemisphere is leftward.','The rule is hemispheric.','The directions are opposite.']),
